  <RimSiege_Petard.label>攻城爆破筒</RimSiege_Petard.label>
  <!-- EN: A powder charge planted against a wall by a sapper. The fuse burns for a few seconds before it detonates. Kill the sapper, or shoot the charge, before it blows a breach. -->
